<section class="accordian-985">
<div class="container">
<div>
<h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
</div>
<div class="row">
<div class="col-lg-6 mt-5">
<h2 class="search-content">Account creation</h2>
<div>

<div class="set mb-3">
<a class="toggle"><div class="accordian-link-text-845"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Vector-1.svg"><h3>How do I create my account?</h3></div></a>
<div class="content">
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">You can <a href="//calendly.com/sales-ninjainfluence/30min?month=2022-07">sign up for a free trial</a> from our website in less than 60 seconds. During the trial, you will be able to see the full value of pain points eliminated by Ninja Influence or get signed up directly to get started with our managed services and let us do the heavy lifting</span></p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="set mb-3">
<a class="toggle"><div class="accordian-link-text-845"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Vector-1.svg"><h3>When will I be charged?</h3></div></a>
<div class="content">
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">By the end of the trial, your inserted payment method will be charged unless you cancel your subscription from your account settings. An email reminder will also be sent to you.<br/>
</span></p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="set mb-3">
<a class="toggle"><div class="accordian-link-text-845"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Vector-1.svg"><h3>How do I add my team?</h3></div></a>
<div class="content">
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Under each pricing plan, there is a number of teats available defined per team.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">From the settings area, users with manager permission can send invitations to other team members( by email) according to the number of seats available.</span></p>
<p><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="model-toggle alignnone wp-image-1914 size-medium" src="//ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/image-1-300x204.png" alt width="300" height="204" srcset="//ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/image-1-300x204.png 300w, //ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/image-1-1024x696.png 1024w, //ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/image-1-768x522.png 768w, //ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/image-1.png 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" /></p>
<div class="model">
<div class="modal-wrapper modal-transition"><button class="modal-close model-toggle"><span class>×</span></button></p>
<div class="modal-content"><img decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-1914 size-full" src="//ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/image-1.png" alt width="1200" height="816" srcset="//ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/image-1.png 1200w, //ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/image-1-300x204.png 300w, //ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/image-1-1024x696.png 1024w, //ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/image-1-768x522.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="col-lg-6 mt-5">
<h2 class="search-content">Campaign creation</h2>
<div>

<div class="set mb-3">
<a class="toggle"><div class="accordian-link-text-845"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Vector-1.svg"><h3>How do I get started?</h3></div></a>
<div class="content">
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">First, you can start by <a href="//calendly.com/sales-ninjainfluence/30min?month=2022-07">signing up for a free trial here</a></span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Or you can <a href="//calendly.com/sales-ninjainfluence/30min?month=2022-07">book a demo with us</a></span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Once the pricing plan is chosen, you can start inviting team members.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Start searching for the right Influencers by filtering and matching, then add them to a campaign.</span></p>
<div class="d-flex" style="grid-gap: 15px;">
<p><img decoding="async" class="modalButton" style="margin-bottom: 15px;" src="//ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/image-2-300x170.png" data-popup="popupOne-1" /></p>
<section id="popupOne-1" class="modals modalWindow">
<section class="modalWrapper"><img decoding="async" src="//ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/image-2.png" /></section>
<p><a class="closeBtn"> X</a></p>
</section>
<section class="modals overlay"></section>
<p><img decoding="async" class="modalButton" style="width: 100%!important;" src="//ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/image-4-1-300x169.png" data-popup="popupOne-2" /></p>
<section id="popupOne-2" class="modals modalWindow">
<section class="modalWrapper"><img decoding="async" src="//ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/image-4-1.png" /></section>
<p><a class="closeBtn"> X</a></p>
</section>
<section class="modals overlay"></section>
</div>
<div class="d-flex" style="grid-gap: 15px;">
<p><img decoding="async" class="modalButton" style="margin-bottom: 15px;" src="//ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/image-5-2-300x170.png" data-popup="popupOne-3" /></p>
<section id="popupOne-3" class="modals modalWindow">
<section class="modalWrapper"><img decoding="async" src="//ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/image-5-2.png" /></section>
<p><a class="closeBtn"> X</a></p>
</section>
<section class="modals overlay"></section>
<p><img decoding="async" class="modalButton" style="width: 100%!important;" src="//ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/image-3-e1655969711103.png" data-popup="popupOne-4" /></p>
<section id="popupOne-4" class="modals modalWindow">
<section class="modalWrapper"><img decoding="async" src="//ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/image-3.svg" /></section>
<p><a class="closeBtn"> X</a></p>
</section>
<section class="modals overlay"></section>
</div>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The campaign contains within it all the influencers you collected. from the campaign itself, you can manage all communication with influencers and track success: by tracking revenue (using your e-commerce platform integration and coupon tracking) and tracking social method activity (tracking URL posts).</span></p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="modalButton" style="margin-top: 15px;" src="//ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/image-6-1-300x165.png" data-popup="popupOne-5" /></p>
<section id="popupOne-5" class="modals modalWindow">
<section class="modalWrapper"><img decoding="async" src="//ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/image-6-1.png" /></section>
<p><a class="closeBtn">X</a></p>
</section>
<section class="modals overlay"></section>
</div>
</div>

<div class="set mb-3">
<a class="toggle"><div class="accordian-link-text-845"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Vector-1.svg"><h3>How many campaigns can I have per month?</h3></div></a>
<div class="content">
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">You can create as many campaigns as you wish within the subscription.</span></p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="set mb-3">
<a class="toggle"><div class="accordian-link-text-845"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Vector-1.svg"><h3>What social media platforms can I use?</h3></div></a>
<div class="content">
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Instagram, YouTube and TiKTok</span></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="col-lg-6 mt-5">
<h2 class="search-content">Managing influence</h2>
<div>

<div class="set mb-3">
<a class="toggle"><div class="accordian-link-text-845"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Vector-1.svg"><h3>How do I find the right influencer?</h3></div></a>
<div class="content">
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">With over 20+ filters you are able to find the influences who best fit your brand to promote your product or services </span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">A niche feature we have along with the ability to check an Influencers followers is related profiles which suggest more Influencers that are right for you.</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><br/>
</span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="set mb-3">
<a class="toggle"><div class="accordian-link-text-845"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Vector-1.svg"><h3>How do I perform Outreach?</h3></div></a>
<div class="content">
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">There are 2 options to perform that action- 1 is from the campaigns page- once you are in the pipeline, you can press each influencer you like to outreach and send a message. you can also change the status of the progress within the pipeline.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The second way is to communicate from the workspace page with the ability to send personalized bulk emails.</span></p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="set mb-3">
<a class="toggle"><div class="accordian-link-text-845"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Vector-1.svg"><h3>How do I add the influencer to my campaign?</h3></div></a>
<div class="content">
<p>You can add them by selecting them in the search results or on the profile with 1 click.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="col-lg-6 mt-5">
<h2 class="search-content">Managing influencers</h2>
<div>

<div class="set mb-3">
<a class="toggle"><div class="accordian-link-text-845"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Vector-1.svg"><h3>How do I track eCommerce sales?</h3></div></a>
<div class="content">
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">First, connect your e-commerce platform under settings or our CSM team will connect for you.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Then under workspace or under the campaigns page, you will be able to pick your e-commerce coupons and add them to the campaign. once set up all purchases made under this coupon will be tracked.</span></p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="model-toggle alignnone wp-image-1914 size-medium" src="//ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/image-8-2.png" alt width="300" height="204" /></p>
<div class="model">
<div class="modal-wrapper modal-transition">
<p><button class="modal-close model-toggle"><span class>×</span></button></p>
<div class="modal-content"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-1924 size-full" src="//ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/image-8-2.png" alt width="1200" height="675" srcset="//ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/image-8-2.png 1200w, //ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/image-8-2-300x169.png 300w, //ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/image-8-2-1024x576.png 1024w, //ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/image-8-2-768x432.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="set mb-3">
<a class="toggle"><div class="accordian-link-text-845"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Vector-1.svg"><h3>Where can I see social engagement?</h3></div></a>
<div class="content">
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">You can also track social media posts&#8217; success by copying the post URL link and adding it to the campaign from the campaigns page or workspace page to the relevant influencer.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Information will be tracked under the campaign dashboard.</span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="model-toggle alignnone wp-image-1914 size-medium" src="//ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/image-9-300x169.png" alt width="300" height="204" /></p>
<div class="model">
<div class="modal-wrapper modal-transition">
<p><button class="modal-close model-toggle"><span class>×</span></button></p>
<div class="modal-content"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter wp-image-1925 size-full" src="//ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/image-9.png" alt width="1200" height="674" srcset="//ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/image-9.png 1200w, //ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/image-9-300x169.png 300w, //ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/image-9-1024x575.png 1024w, //ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/image-9-768x431.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="set mb-3">
<a class="toggle"><div class="accordian-link-text-845"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/2022/04/Vector-1.svg"><h3>Can I track results for each campaign?</h3></div></a>
<div class="content">
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The campaign contains within it all the Influencers you collected. From the campaign itself, you can manage all communication with influencers and track success: by tracking revenue (using your e-commerce platform integration and coupon tracking) and tracking social method activity (tracking URL posts).</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">On the campaign page, under “Dashboard” you have all the statistics needed for measuring success.</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><br/>
</span></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="model-toggle alignnone wp-image-1914 size-medium" src="//ninjainfluence.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/image-7-3-300x165.png" alt width="300" height="204" /></p>
<div class="model">
